### Python Test Suite Fixed (42/42 passing)
- ✅ Fixed in-memory database persistence bug (critical architectural fix)
  - SQLite `:memory:` creates new DB per connection
  - Added `_persistent_conn` to DatabaseManager for in-memory databases
  - File-based databases still use connection-per-operation
- ✅ Fixed `search_notes()` to match schema (title-only search, no content column)
- ✅ Added directory validation to VaultScanner (prevents file-as-vault bugs)
- ✅ Centralized `db_manager` fixture in conftest.py (DRY principle)
- ✅ Fixed API mismatch: `init_db()` → `initialize_database()`
- ✅ **Result:** All Python tests passing (was 29/35, now 42/42) 🎉

